Cadence model assets

This repository distributes versioned model artifacts for Cadence's optional
on-device prescription-text organization feature. The artifacts are based on
Google Gemma models and are subject to the applicable Gemma Terms of Use.

Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

The official Gemma terms are available at:
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

The model manifest in each release records the upstream source revision and
the verified SHA-256 digest. Cadence is not medical advice, and the local
model does not confirm prescriptions or create reminders.
